        "filename": "organiser-update-3.txt",
        "quoted_span": "Date: Thursday, 10 September 2026\nFrom: Sana Sheikh, student coordinator, Innovation Cell\nTo: All Campus Build Sprint teams\nSubject: Campus Build Sprint, update 3: new deadline and Events Portal limit\n\nHi all,\n\nTwo changes this week, and one reminder.\n\n1. Deadline. The submission deadline for Campus Build Sprint moves to 22 Sept. Several teams asked\nfor more time after the portal outage, and Prof. Kulkarni agreed.\n\n2. Events Portal. IT Services has limited the Events Portal API to 60 requests per minute per team key.\nIf your app polls the portal, cache what you can.\n\n3. Reminder. Teams also entering the Inter-College Robotics Expo: expo entries close on 21 Sept. That\nis a separate event with its own form.\n\nReply to this email with any questions.\n\nSana",
