        "filename": "project-brief-v1.pdf",
        "quoted_span": "FestPass project brief · Version: v1 · Date: 31 August 2026\nFestPass project brief\nProgramme\nTeam Lantern is building FestPass for Campus Build Sprint 2026, the two-week programme run\nby the\ncollege Innovation Cell.\nFaculty coordinator: Prof. Meera Kulkarni, Innovation Cell.\nProblem\nRegistrations for Autumn Fest still run on paper forms and group-chat polls. Students register\ntwice\nfor the same event, forms go missing, and organisers can't tell how many seats are left until the\ndoors open.\nGoals\n• A student can find an event and register in under a minute.\n• Every registration produces a QR pass that volunteers scan at the door.\n• Organisers see a live seat count for each event.\nTeam\nAnanya Iyer, Rohan Mehta, Ishita Rao and Dev Malhotra, all second-year students.\nTimeline\nFinal submissions close on 20 September 2026.\nBudget\nBudget cap: ₹50,000 (Innovation Cell grant).\nOut of scope\nPayments for paid workshops, and events outside Autumn Fest.",
        "page_or_section": "Page 1",
