        "quoted_span": "## Action items\n- Ishita: move the staging stack to her AWS profile and update the runbook.\n- Rohan: spike the payment gateway sandbox and report back at Sync 6.\n- Dev: add a test for the cached event list expiring after five minutes.\n- Ananya: share the updated brief with Prof. Kulkarni once the demo flow is stable.",
